// lgpd — Brazil's Lei Geral de Proteção de Dados (Law 13.709/2018)
//
// The law: personal data may leave Brazil only for a country the ANPD has
// found adequate or under safeguards such as its standard contractual
// clauses (Art. 33).
//
// This pack: everything runs in Brazil, on offers with a contract and an
// audit (T2 or better).
//
// Not covered: transfers under the ANPD's clauses or an adequacy finding.
// If you rely on one, write your own policy instead of importing this one.
//
// Use `import "lgpd"`. Not legal advice.

policy lgpd {
  residency = brazil
  min_trust = T2
}
